Transaction text shows inferred cost alongside lot cost while preserving formatting.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1000.000000 FUND
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Cash:At:A:Bank:With:A:Very:Long:Account
account Equity:Opening
account Expenses:Unsorted

include entries/*.ledger

